<title>PORTUGAL: Avg yld 6.6839 pct on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</title>
<headline>Avg yld 6.6839 pct on Portugal 10-yr bonds.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is the result of the Portuguese Institute for Public Credit Management's auction of 25 billion escudos of 10-year fixed-rate bonds (OT).</p>
<p>    ISSUER: Republic of Portugal   MATURITY: 23 February 2007</p>
<p>    AMOUNT PLACED: 11.78 bln esc	 COUPON: 6.625 percent</p>
<p>AVERAGE ACCEPTED YIELD: 6.683888</p>
<p>HIGHEST ACCEPTED: 6.69  LOWEST: 6.67</p>
<p>DEMAND: 70.2 bln esc</p>
<p>PAYMENT FREQUENCY: Annual</p>
<p>NOTES: The issue is fungible. The auction takes to 111.42 billion escudos the total amount of the bonds issued.</p>
<p>-- Lisbon newsroom +351-1-3538254</p>
</text>
